-- Keyword searches, run IN ADDITION to the country+field sweep.
-- v2 (Nov 2026): query_text is matched against TITLE + ABSTRACT only (OpenAlex title_and_abstract.search
-- filter; the old `search=` parameter also matched full text and pulled in dental, astrophysics and
-- politics papers). extra_filter = author-country list + a primary_topic.subfield.id scope per query.
-- No commas in query_text (OpenAlex filter separator) and no * wildcards.
-- Edit freely in the Supabase table editor; set active=false to pause a query.
-- The block at the end upgrades rows seeded by v1 in place (same id), so existing databases can re-run this file.

-- v1 -> v2 upgrade in place (keeps ids, last_run_at and history). No-op on a fresh database.
